				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;downloads&#34;&gt;downloads&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;download-item flex items-center gap-4 mb-8&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;http://douglaslab.org/gelbox/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34; aria-label=&#34;Download Gelbox&#34; class=&#34;w-16 h-16 shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/icons/download_a_cube.png&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; class=&#34;max-w-full max-h-full object-contain&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 class=&#34;mt-4 leading-tight&#34;&gt;Gelbox&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;prose-sm&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Gel electrophoresis simulator (macOS app).&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;download-item flex items-center gap-4 mb-8&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://sdouglas.github.io/lr-notebook/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34; aria-label=&#34;View lr-notebook&#34; class=&#34;w-16 h-16 shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/icons/download_g_cube.png&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; class=&#34;max-w-full max-h-full object-contain&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 class=&#34;mt-4 leading-tight&#34;&gt;lr-notebook&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;prose-sm&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Lektor-based electronic notebook: &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/douglaslab/lr-notebook&#34;&gt;lr-notebook&lt;/a&gt;. The source code is available under the BSD-3 license. Here is a &lt;a href=&#34;https://sdouglas.github.io/lr-notebook/&#34;&gt;live example&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;download-item flex items-center gap-4 mb-8&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://douglaslab.github.io/grantmerge/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34; aria-label=&#34;View GrantMerge&#34; class=&#34;w-16 h-16 shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/icons/download_t_cube.png&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; class=&#34;max-w-full max-h-full object-contain&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h4 class=&#34;mt-4 leading-tight&#34;&gt;GrantMerge&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;prose-sm&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A &lt;a href=&#34;https://douglaslab.github.io/grantmerge/&#34;&gt;tool&lt;/a&gt; to quickly merge spreadsheets into document templates.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
